OL,3,GNEWSAGTA 6: My wife and daughter have
OL,4,Asigned a 'do not disturb' contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Grand Theft Auto superfan Sean
OL,7,FLittle, a week off work to play the
OL,8,Flatest version of the blockbuster video
OL,9,Fgame wasn't enough.
OL,11,FHe knew that if he was spending seven
OL,12,Fdays at home in Dumfries and Galloway,
OL,13,Fhe would be expected to walk the dogs
OL,14,Fand pull his weight in the kitchen.
OL,16,FSo the self-employed painter and
OL,17,Fdecorator persuaded his wife and
OL,18,Fdaughter to sign a "non-interference
OL,19,Fcontract" giving him a week off Dad
OL,20,Fduties.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
